<title>USA: Exide Electronics Group Inc Q4 net shrinks.</title>
<headline>Exide Electronics Group Inc Q4 net shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.09   profit	 $0.42</p>
<p> Shr diluted prof	  0.09   profit	  0.39</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,242   profit	 3,617</p>
<p> Revs		     144,491		  108,798</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,019		    9,776</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.15   profit	 $0.84</p>
<p> Shr diluted loss	  1.15   profit	  0.84</p>
<p> Net loss		  10,314   profit	 7,385</p>
<p> Revs		     459,936		  390,978</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,592		    9,673</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 fiscal year includes a one-time pre-tax charge of $14.6 million for acquisition and restructuring costs taken in the second and third quarters. Excluding the charges and purchase accounting adjustments, pro forma net inccome would have been $2.6 million for the fourth quarter and $5.2 million for the full year.</p>
<p>Period ended September 30.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
